{"suttaId":"tha-ap521","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3359,3439],"vripara":"51"},"segments":{"tha-ap521:0.3":"Sabbaphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap521:1.1":"“Varuṇo nāma nāmena, brāhmaṇo mantapāragū;","tha-ap521:1.3":"Chaḍḍetvā dasaputtāni, vanamajjhogahiṃ tadā.","tha-ap521:2.1":"“Assamaṃ sukataṃ katvā, suvibhattaṃ manoramaṃ;","tha-ap521:2.3":"Paṇṇasālaṃ karitvāna, vasāmi vipine ahaṃ.","tha-ap521:3.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap521:3.3":"Mamuddharitukāmo so, āgacchi mama assamaṃ.","tha-ap521:4.1":"“Yāvatā vanasaṇḍamhi, obhāso vipulo ahu;","tha-ap521:4.3":"Buddhassa ānubhāvena, pajjalī vipinaṃ tadā.","tha-ap521:5.1":"“Disvāna taṃ pāṭihīraṃ, buddhaseṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap521:5.3":"Pattapuṭaṃ gahetvāna, phalena pūjayiṃ ahaṃ.","tha-ap521:6.1":"“Upagantvāna sambuddhaṃ, sahakhārimadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap521:6.3":"Anukampāya me buddho, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","tha-ap521:7.1":"‘Khāribhāraṃ gahetvāna, pacchato ehi me tuvaṃ;","tha-ap521:7.3":"Paribhutte ca saṅghamhi, puññaṃ tava bhavissati’.","tha-ap521:8.1":"“Puṭakantaṃ gahetvāna, bhikkhusaṅghassadāsahaṃ;","tha-ap521:8.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, tusitaṃ upapajjahaṃ.","tha-ap521:9.1":"“Tattha dibbehi naccehi, gītehi vāditehi ca;","tha-ap521:9.3":"Puññakammena saṃyuttaṃ, anubhomi sadā sukhaṃ.","tha-ap521:10.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap521:10.3":"Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:11.1":"“Yāvatā caturo dīpā, sasamuddā sapabbatā;","tha-ap521:11.3":"Phalaṃ buddhassa datvāna, issaraṃ kārayāmahaṃ.","tha-ap521:12.1":"“Yāvatā me pakkhigaṇā, ākāse uppatanti ce;","tha-ap521:12.3":"Tepi maṃ vasamanventi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:13.1":"“Yāvatā vanasaṇḍamhi, yakkhā bhūtā ca rakkhasā;","tha-ap521:13.3":"Kumbhaṇḍā garuḷā cāpi, pāricariyaṃ upenti me.","tha-ap521:14.1":"“Kumbhā soṇā madhukārā, ḍaṃsā ca makasā ubho;","tha-ap521:14.3":"Tepi maṃ vasamanventi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:15.1":"“Supaṇṇā nāma sakuṇā, pakkhijātā mahabbalā;","tha-ap521:15.3":"Tepi maṃ saraṇaṃ yanti, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:16.1":"“Yepi dīghāyukā nāgā, iddhimanto mahāyasā;","tha-ap521:16.3":"Tepi maṃ vasamanventi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:17.1":"“Sīhā byagghā ca dīpī ca, acchakokataracchakā;","tha-ap521:17.3":"Tepi maṃ vasamanventi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:18.1":"“Osadhītiṇavāsī ca, ye ca ākāsavāsino;","tha-ap521:18.3":"Sabbe maṃ saraṇaṃ yanti, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:19.1":"“Sududdasaṃ sunipuṇaṃ, gambhīraṃ suppakāsitaṃ;","tha-ap521:19.3":"Phassayitvā [phusayitvā (ka.)] viharāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:20.1":"“Vimokkhe aṭṭha phusitvā, viharāmi anāsavo;","tha-ap521:20.3":"Ātāpī nipako cāhaṃ, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:21.1":"“Ye phalaṭṭhā buddhaputtā, khīṇadosā mahāyasā;","tha-ap521:21.3":"Ahamaññataro tesaṃ, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:22.1":"“Abhiññāpāramiṃ gantvā, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap521:22.3":"Sabbāsave pariññāya, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap521:23.1":"“Tevijjā iddhipattā ca, buddhaputtā mahāyasā;","tha-ap521:23.3":"Dibbasotasamāpannā, tesaṃ aññataro ahaṃ.","tha-ap521:24.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap521:24.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap521:25.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap521:26.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap521:27.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap521:28.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sabbaphaladāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap521:29.1":"Sabbaphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
